  "mandatory_rules": [
    "ProtectedRecordRef has no supplied path; object_id equals sha256. Resolver uses only the independently authenticated PublisherRootSelection and exact selected root identity, computes objects/<sha>, opens with no-follow protection and rechecks bytes/root before and after. Selection does not refer to its own hash; its exact bytes and authorizer verification key are selected externally.",
    "All 17 ReleaseEvidenceSlot values occur exactly once. Each reference is constrained by the exact publisher/root/kind/purpose/use/schema grant, not just its digest. role_read_isolation_receipt_sha256 refers in this successor to the exact NarrowRoleReleaseEvidence1 body and NR01..NR12 in role-release-evidence.candidate.json; old broad-denial receipts are never manufactured or relabeled.",
    "Root selection observations are actual external appointment/initialization facts, not source-created values. Missing selected root identity, changed device/inode/ownership, write/restore uncertainty or unavailable current authority fails closed.",
